# The voice pin: one sherpa-onnx runtime per flavour, and the three
# models it runs -- the mouth (Kokoro v1.0, text to speech), the ears
# (Whisper base, speech to text) and the end of a spoken question (the
# Silero voice activity detector). Each row is "<url> <bytes> <sha256>".
# Nothing here is vendored: `spark voice on|clear` downloads what is
# missing into ~/.local/share/spark/voice, checks the size and the
# sha256 before it unpacks a byte, and lib/spark/voice.py reads this
# file. The licences ride beside each row; CREDITS.md names them all.
VOICE_RUNTIME_VERSION=v1.13.8
